  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 980 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 985599 at Baxter Healthcare Corporation (FEI 2618677) ended on 2016-10-03 and was classified OAI, 980 days before FDA posted the potassium chloride shortage on 2019-06-10.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E59"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional OAI classifications at the same plant occurred in 2010, 2013, 2014, and 2015, with a VAI inspection in 2018 and another VAI in 2024.",
      "cites": ["E51", "E54", "E56", "E58", "E60", "E61"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second Baxter plant (FEI 1416980) received an OAI classification in 2024 and another in 2026, followed by a Warning Letter on 2026-09-29.",
      "cites": ["E39", "E41", "E42"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085) received an OAI classification in 2019 and a Warning Letter in 2020.",
      "cites": ["E84", "E86"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343) had multiple OAI inspections between 2010 and 2011, with a Warning Letter in 2010.",
      "cites": ["E68", "E70", "E72", "E77"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 88 months.",
      "cites": ["D27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected alternate manufacturer is A-S Medication Solutions, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D24"]
    }
  ]
}
